<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end stronger, more gains expected.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end stronger, more gains expected.</headline>
<text>
<p>1515 GMT - Bonos end higher on Tuesday. Long future above resistance of 115.50 seen opening door to more gains short run</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 105.45 vs 104.97, yield 6.58 vs 6.63</p>
<p>* June bond future 115.53 vs 115.08 at yesterday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.40/41 vs 84.47/50</p>
